[Triggers]
Block	1	CaveHornet
Block	1	Spider
Block	1	Rat
Block	1	Roach
Block	1	Goblin
Block	1	LavaSpawn
Block	1	LizardMan
Block	1	Orc
Block	1	PitDemon
Region	Shelf	3	30	56	42
Region	WestLanding	8	29	28	33
Region	EastLanding	46	29	54	34
Region	Yard	14	13	46	24
Region	Keep	22	3	38	10
Region	EastGate	44	16	52	24
[Trigger]
Name	firstCall
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The Ravensledge fort sits on three cliff shelves, my lord, and the chasms between them have only a few crossings. Captain Osric Vane keeps archers on every ledge.
Action	objective	1	Slay Captain Osric Vane in the keep on the highest shelf.
Action	objective	1	Cross the lower chasm and take the middle shelf.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	purseFilled
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	700
Action	message	1	The cliff gold is paying off. Doors and cannons will cover your bridgeheads.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	shelfReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Shelf
Action	message	1	You are over the first chasm. The upper bridges are watched, so make the shelf your own before you cross.
Action	reveal	1	WestLanding
Action	reveal	1	EastLanding
Action	objective	1	Claim 80 tiles of the middle shelf.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	shelfHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Shelf	80
Action	message	1	The shelf is yours. Now bring something sturdy across the upper bridge.
Action	reveal	1	Yard
Action	objective	1	Cross the upper chasm and break into the yard.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	yardEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Yard
Action	message	1	The yard bell is ringing. Vane has sent his sentries down to meet you.
Action	spawn	3	30	15	1	Knight:2	Elf:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
Action	reveal	1	Keep
Action	objective	1	Break the inner gate to the keep.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	flankSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	EastGate
Action	message	1	The east gate was meant for supply carts. A squad is already running to close it.
Action	spawn	3	48	8	1	Dwarf2:2	Adventurer:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstRaid
Mode	once
Cond	time	600
Action	message	1	Raiders are crossing the lower bridge from the shelf above.
Action	spawn	3	47	37	1	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondRaid
Mode	once
Cond	time	1300
Action	message	1	The captain is sending a stronger party down the cliff road.
Action	spawn	3	12	40	1	Knight:2	Elf:2	Dwarf1:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	thirdRaid
Mode	once
Cond	time	2100
Action	message	1	Vane is pulling in every archer he has. Do not let them reach your heart.
Action	spawn	3	47	36	1	Knight:3	Elf:3	Elf:2	Adventurer:3	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	captainDown
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	Captain Vane has fallen and the ravens have left the ledge. Ravensledge is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	osricWavers
Mode	once
Cond	health	OsricVane	<	40
Action	message	1	The captain is hurt. The fort's last guards are rushing to the keep.
Action	spawn	3	30	8	1	Knight:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
